  "$comment": "CONTEXT-HELP rule 17: one row per surface the product draws, read by the resolver at run time and by tools/help/check-help.ps1 at check time. Forms built in this product: page, inherit, none (layer and both are in the contract and not built). host = the class that draws the surface (Class#member for a call-site dialog); ask 'off' = the window deliberately wires neither F1 nor the button. elements = the entries of the page in marker order: anchor on the page, view = the resource entry name the generator pins and F1 looks up, nameRes = the string the UI shows (the page takes the name from it); shot false = shown only in some states, so it carries no marker. Prose lives in docs/help/src, pages and screenshots in this folder are generated by tools/help/build-help.ps1.",
